        "rationale": "Half of 1 cm is 0.5 cm, and 23 − 0.5 = 22.5."
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "content": "22 cm",
        "rationale": "A length of 22.4 cm would round to 22 cm, not 23 cm: use half a unit."
      },
      {
