        "content": "23.5 cm",
        "rationale": "That is the upper bound."
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "To the nearest centimetre the unit is 1 cm, so the bounds are $0.5$ cm either side: $22.5 \\leq l < 23.5$. The lower bound is $22.5$ cm.",
